Wokwi chip API: the three Wokwi custom chips in v2/hardware/wokwi are this
project's own source (*.chip.c). They include Wokwi's wokwi-api.h at build
time, which is not distributed here. Earlier commits contain compiled .wasm
builds of them that include small inline fragments of that header. The header
copy that built them is not recorded. The only public copy with a license is in
https://github.com/wokwi/inverter-chip (MIT). The header Wokwi serves today has
no license notice in the file and differs from that copy.

Inspection note (Nov 24 2026): the historical head firmware image contains
LVGL (MIT), libpng and newlib strings; the audio image contains newlib. Newlib
is the ESP-IDF C library (BSD-style and other permissive licenses, see
https://sourceware.org/newlib/). The historical wasm chips contain this
project's compiled code plus WASI libc stubs and the names of the Wokwi API
imports. They contain no license or copyright text.
